      "notes": {
        "x": 20, "y": 820, "w": 1270, "h": 140,
        "text": "Request flow: (1) user signs in via Entra ID SSO  (2) FastAPI decomposes the question  (3) hybrid search (keyword + vector, top-k) filtered by the user's Entra group IDs  (4) semantic re-ranking  (5) GPT-5 answers and validates groundedness against the top passages  (6) response with citations.\nKey controls: security trimming on every query (OBO flow) | APIM token-per-minute limits, circuit breaker to fallback model, semantic cache | PII + content safety before and after the LLM | private endpoints, managed identity, no keys | golden-question evaluation + tokens per user in App Insights.\nCost note: the validation step adds a second LLM call per request; include it in the token model."
      }
