        "x": 20, "y": 620, "w": 1340, "h": 130,
        "text": "Ingestion rules: event-driven via queue (not a blind cron) | idempotent on (documentId, version, content hash) | retries + dead-letter queue + alert | chunk by headings with overlap, keep title / page / source URL / version on each chunk | store allowed Entra group IDs on every chunk for security trimming | on update or delete, remove old chunks | nightly reconcile compares SharePoint against the index.\nSource files: approved PDFs only; rejected files never reach the pipeline."
